[
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5DWV8ENRJDAS42MJCGWG580",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Kai has had a headache for three days, both temples, dull and pressing, after cutting back on coffee a week ago.",
    "importance": 0.4225,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5DWRH0YEJDKFZBSVJS6TGSS",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5DWRVXQHHD3ZEE2GTCW65K0",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T00:12:45.396Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5DWV8ENRJDAS42MJCGWG581",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Kai's headache fits caffeine withdrawal: it hits 12-24 hours after a sharp drop and can last up to nine days.",
    "importance": 0.465,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5DWRH0YEJDKFZBSVJS6TGSS",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5DWSHP0ZBB13QZ5M0GV3D5D",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T00:12:45.396Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5DWV8ENRJDAS42MJCGWG582",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Kai has no fever, neck stiffness, confusion, weakness, vision changes or pain on bending forward.",
    "importance": 0.395,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5DWRH0YEJDKFZBSVJS6TGSS",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5DWSHP0ZBB13QZ5M0GV3D5D",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T00:12:45.396Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5DWV8ENRJDAS42MJCGWG583",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Amara advised Kai to taper caffeine slowly, keep fluids up, and check back if the headache is not easing by about day nine.",
    "importance": 0.5475,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5DWRH0YEJDKFZBSVJS6TGSS",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5DWTACP6HQHS0SE6J2XKWQK",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T00:12:45.396Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5DWV8ENRJDAS42MJCGWG584",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Amara told Kai that a sudden severe headache reaching its worst within a minute needs emergency care, as do fever, neck stiffness, confusion, weakness, vision changes, slurred speech, face drooping, or a non-fading rash.",
    "importance": 0.5975,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5DWRH0YEJDKFZBSVJS6TGSS",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5DWTACP6HQHS0SE6J2XKWQK",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T00:12:45.396Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5DXBZTBJHG2JNZRR32GQMN2",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Amara argued for a nationwide four-day work week, citing two wards where a compressed four-day rota cut burnout about a fifth in twelve weeks with throughput and readmissions stable.",
    "importance": 0.75,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5DXA4JAGXCC4R5JMKZNS8DF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5DXA66501KRFE4BCRSAEZNE",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T00:21:53.609Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5DXBZTD2EXKTY481E3FKR6Z",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Amara's emergency department burnout rose from 29% in March to 41% by January, with nurses resigning at 14% a year and each replacement costing about four months' salary.",
    "importance": 0.735,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5DXA4JAGXCC4R5JMKZNS8DF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5DXA66501KRFE4BCRSAEZNE",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T00:21:53.609Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5DXBZTEA53MKDTGR15MFZCB",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Amara conceded her review did not test whole-department round-the-clock cover and that the emergency department proper needs further modelling.",
    "importance": 0.675,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5DXA4JAGXCC4R5JMKZNS8DF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5DXB6JEX43NRZXGNNQ14RA3",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T00:21:53.609Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5DXBZTFP1WMY7SYY33Z5XK2",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Amara's ward review found burnout fell 19% and 22%, sleep before shifts improved 40 minutes, and a 6% agency-hours transition premium faded to baseline by week eight.",
    "importance": 0.7175,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5DXA4JAGXCC4R5JMKZNS8DF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5DXB6JEX43NRZXGNNQ14RA3",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T00:21:53.609Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5DX648AVDPDWMFK7RTX4HSN",
    "characterId": "chr_seedHana",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Kai is treating everyone to dinner tonight; Hana asked for the udon place and her grandma's tamagoyaki as the new dish.",
    "importance": 0.495,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5DX2QVQRGKG60Z15J82WKHS",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5DX30A2VBWBW1MXD9N9WX3F",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T00:18:41.546Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5DX648AVDPDWMFK7RTX4HSP",
    "characterId": "chr_seedHana",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Hana's family rule: one dish everyone loves, one nobody's tried, no skipping.",
    "importance": 0.6275,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5DX2QVQRGKG60Z15J82WKHS",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5DX4DQYJEC841HXDR9TF95A",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T00:18:41.546Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5DXA50XNQTV6X1Z8FRMG3CY",
    "characterId": "chr_seedHana",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Hana sold out of pink ranunculus by noon, then knocked over a bucket of water and mopped the floor twice.",
    "importance": 0.3125,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5DX6BWH5YYRE3CJEN9C8E40",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5DX79HWDA3N1ZF2BBCZKNRX",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T00:20:53.402Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5DXA50YV0T37WKKRPY3HFJ4",
    "characterId": "chr_seedHana",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Hana baked a small batch of lemon cookies for Rin's exam week and ate three while warm.",
    "importance": 0.4225,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5DX6BWH5YYRE3CJEN9C8E40",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5DX7Z8PZ002EP67NH8NFGCB",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T00:20:53.402Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5DXBZTS3X4JKBPJ48PZJEMC",
    "characterId": "chr_seedMei",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Mei argued the pilots covered no hospitals, transport operators or care homes, and fewer than half the firms measured output consistently, so the gains were partly redistributed rather than created.",
    "importance": 0.69,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5DXA4JAGXCC4R5JMKZNS8DF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5DXA6541X0K8Q8YZ8GX3DQ2",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T00:21:53.609Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5DXBZV1K1RSSB3GMGGFY9GG",
    "characterId": "chr_seedMei",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Mei cited nine shift-based organisations holding coverage constant that needed 18% to 27% more staffed hours on a shorter week; two clawed part back within six months, seven did not measure it.",
    "importance": 0.7,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5DXA4JAGXCC4R5JMKZNS8DF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5DXAQXAZP0SN44J2452JSAG",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T00:21:53.609Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5DXBZV3SPT37475MPFG8PMQ",
    "characterId": "chr_seedMei",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Mei conceded the status-quo-is-also-a-policy line lands and that doing nothing costs money in absence, agency fees and resignations.",
    "importance": 0.6075,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5DXA4JAGXCC4R5JMKZNS8DF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5DXAVQXGCEG3976KAGVCRKE",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T00:21:53.609Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5DXBZV45ZGNXKEZ5Y9GH1PN",
    "characterId": "chr_seedMei",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Mei closed urging sequence, explicit exemption of continuous services, and mandated measurement before a nationwide default, calling Amara's ward result good but untested for round-the-clock cover.",
    "importance": 0.7075,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5DXA4JAGXCC4R5JMKZNS8DF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5DXBC25RMPPYX1AEJD1ENBK",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T00:21:53.609Z"
  },
  {
