  {
    "id": "mem_01M5DXBZTG4PRRDMDV8ZHDBKZH",
    "characterId": "chr_seedVictor",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Victor argued that nationwide means a statutory default week with a transition, not an identical schedule, citing the Working Hours Act 1931 as precedent for phasing and continuous-service exemptions.",
    "importance": 0.7225,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5DXA4JAGXCC4R5JMKZNS8DF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5DXA65K4DCVXVZFYZD8EC9R",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T00:21:53.609Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5DXBZTNNE8SC3RZJKP3K5GY",
    "characterId": "chr_seedVictor",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Victor conceded Mei's 18-27% staffed-hours premium across nine continuous-coverage operations was real and measured where coverage was held constant.",
    "importance": 0.655,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5DXA4JAGXCC4R5JMKZNS8DF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5DXB0PRF3DPFQ4FK7TTSCNP",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T00:21:53.609Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5DXBZTPPCF5EA85ES8VJV8P",
    "characterId": "chr_seedVictor",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Victor argued the status quo also runs unmeasured, so both the mandate's cost and the saving from doing nothing belong on the same ledger.",
    "importance": 0.67,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5DXA4JAGXCC4R5JMKZNS8DF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5DXB0PRF3DPFQ4FK7TTSCNP",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T00:21:53.609Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5DXBZTQJZHDZR0HE2Y83NVV",
    "characterId": "chr_seedVictor",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Victor closed that the motion already contains sequencing: set the default, exempt continuous services explicitly, phase by sector, and mandate measurement.",
    "importance": 0.685,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5DXA4JAGXCC4R5JMKZNS8DF",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5DXBHBXN1ASXGQCF5KX41ET",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-21T00:21:53.609Z"
  }
